WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.320
Hi, everybody. My name is Jack Campbell,

00:02.320 --> 00:05.120
I'm the founder of Alexander Legacy
Private Wealth,

00:05.120 --> 00:07.720
and I've had a tremendous time here
at this amazing roundtable

00:07.720 --> 00:11.440
that is helping to drive more opportunity
and activity

00:11.440 --> 00:15.160
on the beautiful continent of Africa,
specifically in Ghana.

00:15.160 --> 00:17.360
Listen, for me, it's all about workforce,

00:17.360 --> 00:19.480
and if we're going to see
major investment,

00:19.480 --> 00:22.240
we need to make sure
that people have jobs,

00:22.240 --> 00:25.240
and not just jobs,
great-paying jobs, high-demand jobs.

00:25.240 --> 00:28.160
And with the wealth transfer
happening right now

00:28.160 --> 00:30.400
to the tune of $124 trillion

00:30.400 --> 00:32.480
that's going to the next generation,
the time is now.

00:32.480 --> 00:34.400
So let's get our young people trained up,

00:34.400 --> 00:36.000
let's get a workforce together,

00:36.000 --> 00:37.360
and I'll meet you in Ghana.
